    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always had a strong connection with mathematics, especially since it was one of my favorite subjects in school. My vocational diploma included math courses, and I still find it useful in everyday life—like budgeting or understanding patterns in nature. I enjoy solving problems and seeing how logic shapes solutions, even if I don’t always use it professionally.",
